{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34392","headline":"酬袭美夏首病愈见招次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"酬袭美夏首病愈见招次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨多青合是垣衣，一幅蛮牋夜欵扉。\n蕙带又闻宽沈约，茅斋犹自忆王微。\n方灵祗在君臣正，篆古须抛点画肥。\n除却伴谈秋水外，野鸥何处更忘机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}